    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1310.0910v1</id>
    <title>Helly type theorems for the sum of vectors in a normed plane</title>
    <updated>2013-10-03T06:43:32Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1310.0910v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.0910v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>The main results here are two Helly type theorems for the sum of (at most) unit vectors in a normed plane. Also, we give a new characterization of centrally symmetric convex sets in the plane.</summary>
